{"id":"520755","name":"土豆卤肉饭","author":"我是土豆","authorId":"192408","desc":"","cover":"images/520755/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪瘦肉","amount":"500g（自己决定）（有点肥的应该更香）"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"4个"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"生抽","amount":"3勺"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"糖","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"瘦肉切丁。","img":"images/520755/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"土豆切小块。","img":"images/520755/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洋葱切丁放入油锅小火慢慢煸焦。","img":"images/520755/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"焦到这种。","img":"images/520755/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"国内加油倒入肉肉翻炒。","img":"images/520755/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"肉肉炒干加土豆。","img":"images/520755/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"➕生抽、盐、蚝油、一丢糖翻炒。","img":"images/520755/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加水焖制熟烂。","img":"images/520755/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"汤汁浓稠就可以了。","img":"images/520755/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"香喷喷，干饭神器。","img":"images/520755/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"真的好好吃。","img":"images/520755/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"汤汁一点要熬得浓稠才好吃噢！下饭高配【卤肉饭】 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}